/// RecoveryPointSelection has five parameters (three required and two
/// optional). The values you specify determine which recovery point is
/// included in the restore test. You must indicate with Algorithm if you
/// want the latest recovery point within your SelectionWindowDays or if you
/// want a random recovery point, and you must indicate through
/// IncludeVaults from which vaults the recovery points can be chosen.
